  "observations": [
    "Seven requests returned HTTP 200 with all 200 integers, status completed or finish_reason stop, and reported output greater than the requested 16 tokens. One Chat reasoning_effort=none request had URLError at about 60 seconds, with no response or usage available; it was not retried.",
    "Nonstreaming Responses reported 652 output tokens; Chat max_tokens reported 1104; Chat max_completion_tokens reported 630. These failures to honor the requested limit occurred outside Chronicle.",
    "Responses reasoning.effort=none and Chat thinking.type=disabled still produced nonzero reasoning usage. This proves those tested controls did not disable reported reasoning on this route, but does not identify where they were ignored or overridden.",
    "Both routes delivered SSE incrementally. Responses reached response.completed with 912 output tokens; Chat reached stop plus [DONE] with 642. Responses completion does not require a literal [DONE] marker.",
    "Streaming changes delivery, not the single-generation token budget. These small stream successes do not establish complete-chapter success or that streaming removes the previously observed approximately 65536-token termination.",
    "The pinned public CPA Responses-to-Chat translator maps max_output_tokens to max_tokens and reasoning.effort to reasoning_effort; the compatible executor then applies configurable payload overrides/filters. The actual route configuration and forwarded request remain unavailable, so CPA versus its upstream cannot yet be separated.",
    "Chronicle currently sends a nonstreaming Responses request and preserves the configured output-token value. Its byte limit was not reached in the prior 131072-budget chapter run; the remote response reported incomplete/max_output_tokens.",
    "No production transport change, generation retry, chapter summary, review, publication, or deployment was made for this diagnosis."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Private HTTP bodies remain only in the controlled diagnostic directory; no reasoning text or credentials are archived here.",
    "Body and assembled-message SHA/lengths were independently recalculated from private responses without another model call. The 42 boolean checks across seven available replies passed; this is deterministic evidence verification, not independent content acceptance.",
    "No actual CPA configuration or upstream credentials were available. No direct request to the underlying model service was made.",
    "Costs are unknown; the failed request has no reported usage."
  ]
